:"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/340520?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ferdinandsalis/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ferdinandsalis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ferdinandsalis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ferdinandsalis/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ferdinandsalis","id":340520,"login":"ferdinandsalis","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0MDUyMA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ferdinandsalis/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ferdinandsalis/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ferdinandsalis/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ferdinandsalis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ferdinandsalis/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ferdinandsalis","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ferdinandsalis/walz/commits/0db07a10b41d1ebaedd49164cca1a7670f6c387b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T11:46:40Z","email":"mail@ferdinandsalis.com","name":"Ferdinand Salis"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T11:46:40Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Type tType against the event types from EventSchema (#139)\n\ntType''s parameter was typed as Event[''type''], but the event model had\nno Event type, so it resolved to the DOM Event interface and accepted\nany string. The model now exports Event, so callers are checked against\nthe seven event types or null. Labels and the passthrough are\nunchanged. Aktuelles and Die Walz kennenlernen import that type instead\nof each inferring their own.","tree":{"sha":"9d79133cbb24891d59687b521e5a05009a4e3268","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ferdinandsalis/walz/git/trees/9d79133cbb24891d59687b521e5a05009a4e3268"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ferdinandsalis/walz/git/commits/0db07a10b41d1ebaedd49164cca1a7670f6c387b","verification":{"payload":"tree 9d79133cbb24891d59687b521e5a05009a4e3268\nparent 77500e8d7b574c6e8ed6cdbd51e6ff075cc0e40a\nauthor Ferdinand Salis <mail@ferdinandsalis.com> 1790768800 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790768800 +0200\n\nType tType against the event types from EventSchema (#139)\n\ntType''s parameter was typed as Event[''type''], but the event model had\nno Event type, so it resolved to the DOM Event interface and accepted\nany string. The model now exports Event, so callers are checked against\nthe seven event types or null. Labels and the passthrough are\nunchanged. Aktuelles and Die Walz kennenlernen import that type instead\nof each inferring their own.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqvPagCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAkgYQAIyAVLfSJavusZ7A0PHSB6AR\nV6xq3EHPy5hz4GX0wSU8cpU1hk51LuBMrM50bad8YAURb9G1eoBtzRQa1Csh3uaP\nRVsVYsSLSCItUpHruM7evPNOLW1Vn1x49sTVk6Bglob14TK9d0v53PhQwp3W1mMB\nU+SoNM2x8Vyzf1B2ZeMromQuxeFEtCXHnONS2jNcEHzVsZzRRdD1k3nrMAWto8Yn\nE3g4Q2npdMdJp8MYgzsO9SBCcHrLbadRXKMHA2YQk8G+8BuE1290oXAH2rbRR65i\nRo6aLbT5F84t1U6pYolASOZD3rronwrLYTueylrffbvmmWQ5UiXpkWPUH+zS2IHk\nmJuXYS/DEp5NVk+HI8nhfP7g4Vpp4Df1si5doxLtHNE7hBp8MkV3woL1i59GFUKi\nJ7gFgTAjehpnRvm8i8GusWktStLYm7ybrX1UsZRKs0ia9R1GyXh0X0WGW6DVdfaL\nSq5YyGypJXNRYKMBkvWW1VCaLFtYic9LSVT2F+FEp+CINk0JWlsNQ5PykG9djqBn\nPFTtA2ASpXkFnzYKhQYjyEf+x87OBoQNgPyC6PAyTiS/dnkkjbiQiZ6sIFN6Ft3x\nEGRC6cqG8P9NOYTwzTSA1NUF+RiqIVgX00+slhgTgAyznKwBDqixI6giVo6Kl7QH\n9ayIAPlVY3zYgfC4OEX8\n=bA5I\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-30T11:46:41Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/w