pi.github.com/users/ferdinandsalis/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ferdinandsalis","id":340520,"login":"ferdinandsalis","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0MDUyMA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ferdinandsalis/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ferdinandsalis/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ferdinandsalis/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ferdinandsalis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ferdinandsalis/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ferdinandsalis","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ferdinandsalis/walz/commits/a25c0fe206a6c0f4bc549cb2d847accc903e7462/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T05:56:11Z","email":"mail@ferdinandsalis.com","name":"Ferdinand Salis"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T05:56:11Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Show the 404 page for missing posts, Jahrgänge and Termine (#133)\n\nOnly unknown top-level URLs reached the 404 page. A post or Jahrgang that\ndoes not exist (or is not published yet) crashed the render and answered\n500 \"Unexpected Server Error\", and each one was reported to Sentry\n(WALZ-6C: 59 events for the unpublished theater post). A missing Termin\ndid answer 404, but fell through to the root boundary and rendered a\nbare line of text without header or footer.\n\n- The post and Jahrgang loaders throw a 404 when Sanity finds nothing,\n  as the Termin loader already did. A Jahrgang URL without the\n  \"<letter>-<year>\" shape 404s before querying instead of failing the\n  GROQ query.\n- The 404 content moves from $.tsx into NotFoundErrorBoundary, which all\n  four routes export, so the page renders inside the site layout.\n- Page titles fall back to \"Beitrag\" / \"Jahrgang\" instead of reading\n  \"undefined | Walz\" on a 404.\n\nFixes WALZ-6C","tree":{"sha":"94299c24302530b278e2ff868dbfc60089fa436b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ferdinandsalis/walz/git/trees/94299c24302530b278e2ff868dbfc60089fa436b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ferdinandsalis/walz/git/commits/a25c0fe206a6c0f4bc549cb2d847accc903e7462","verification":{"payload":"tree 94299c24302530b278e2ff868dbfc60089fa436b\nparent bdd62a3fd3b434fd23edb1faa63b5f24c3faec7e\nauthor Ferdinand Salis <mail@ferdinandsalis.com> 1790747771 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790747771 +0200\n\nShow the 404 page for missing posts, Jahrgänge and Termine (#133)\n\nOnly unknown top-level URLs reached the 404 page. A post or Jahrgang that\ndoes not exist (or is not published yet) crashed the render and answered\n500 \"Unexpected Server Error\", and each one was reported to Sentry\n(WALZ-6C: 59 events for the unpublished theater post). A missing Termin\ndid answer 404, but fell through to the root boundary and rendered a\nbare line of text without header or footer.\n\n- The post and Jahrgang loaders throw a 404 when Sanity finds nothing,\n  as the Termin loader already did. A Jahrgang URL without the\n  \"<letter>-<year>\" shape 404s before querying instead of failing the\n  GROQ query.\n- The 404 content moves from $.tsx into NotFoundErrorBoundary, which all\n  four routes export, so the page renders inside the site layout.\n- Page titles fall back to \"Beitrag\" / \"Jahrgang\" instead of reading\n  \"undefined | Walz\" on a 404.\n\nFixes WALZ-6C","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqvKR7CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA9wkQABR4U16XI6a1YYCWFd5bCQ6V\nDx7AF5Q3b5j5xvN6F4+jV9OAl+kaUyjuQA9INXSWfjPD3jBbabCgu9AEQ0ANngV3\nVmj84+fB3LIbfP6pcypNPXYymRyRd6JAuxmj8qF+rxssyP2vzyX4zPvte5ABr7ez\n2ovqEyd81JcKtxH8PdWstnH1VV9ypbCtdduiH1+WhrYd7dThnDq+kVPIUNTixnf0\njAm5MBCIOue8q0abE7RQjNPk64erZ36chJSL0PLgiUNk0vb9HG11dIQrPW17dw2v\n6tpMGh4Jfcu0Epgk5Lzn0ODqbZs1RDwHuJy8VVbTqfY7hzp5wb9t7yABy9wnCT6d\nmVPpQkCNVW/TkUfNpWTTPFz0W1uHF4JFBsHsFg8Oqz31illuD