ext and vector art are unaffected by\n  the downsampling.\n- Cover cropped from the front half of the outer cover spread (the\n  magazine is laid out as spreads, 420x260mm).","tree":{"sha":"773d25f98461fd0dfa6f062fba4b7db318374cd6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ferdinandsalis/walz/git/trees/773d25f98461fd0dfa6f062fba4b7db318374cd6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ferdinandsalis/walz/git/commits/1fafe4a0ae02c325e75410e3a17ccb060c75948c","verification":{"payload":"tree 773d25f98461fd0dfa6f062fba4b7db318374cd6\nparent 283674a67c6fecba71c6e3540b9c1daa5b5c74b5\nauthor Ferdinand Salis <mail@ferdinandsalis.com> 1788514214 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788514214 +0200\n\nAdd Walz Zeit Nr. 02 as the current magazine, archive 24/25 (#132)\n\n- New issue as ''Aktuell'' with the inline reader, download link and cover\n  thumbnail; 24/25 moves into the archive as a download link.\n- The PDF is served at 150 dpi (12.5 MB, in line with the 24/25 issue at\n  14.5 MB). The print original is 63 MB, which is too heavy to load in\n  the inline ''Online lesen'' viewer; text and vector art are unaffected by\n  the downsampling.\n- Cover cropped from the front half of the outer cover spread (the\n  magazine is laid out as spreads, 420x260mm).","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqmo+mCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAKoIQADwIJ7EoM6P0H+Eu2l+loesq\nk+UsSXYiXuahamlnu46gIihF36znmgqAcaIWxSquMG4J5eNEWMtfT57XGg9iGy4Z\n/PZVKd1i0N+wEDZYW5uGMagLrqtDgwE9ERWBI5n74cUp9u5fm5/mSe8HvIaBsGHU\nKhY1opIQYhdjtFvQ6zhkBGO7yhy6vKnSYEyjvu4UF6PW6OqBoNmpCIkpZJ5ky1Bk\n/dtgnb72ihP/NTUcWcyLwaWvSPCZXe565DsHN6w5C3jb1L5fgeXOKMKDi+grxNG0\nsZuR91fhUFapF9QLJjx/b+KUxD/r0fTHjGVByOnWuXH9hM7MKyaZ99+4LByDnXWN\nD9R0cPiI0ll6uYQpbnAIunzPgKQ2Qb4hGUUXh+BntIL1WcXmV6xi9RrZMeQcv6fW\n4weFM+e+1WTUL9I3lk5tjRXHEZDpPJZvfkmD/OKib1eNvx9Uf3AHWiejJrslXJha\nfP5kVa2SSvi0Ay2sNoI9ZxV9dvM7lHj4sKjCa7Wagcg8pJ+prbyII3mYKPMHm6/e\nrxBjrTXxnkvyExDxnh3gTA2ph+ROapWmI31RFKOxC4LJtGKDAsDu0tQ49C/V4Z4s\nlk3lI22ce