ty alerts and security-update PRs\nstay enabled in repo settings as the early-warning layer.","tree":{"sha":"fb6d801802b827b49db846656d5e66496130925b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ferdinandsalis/walz/git/trees/fb6d801802b827b49db846656d5e66496130925b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ferdinandsalis/walz/git/commits/77ffb92079ccc0c07c5107f7c49c9824a6646f3c","verification":{"payload":"tree fb6d801802b827b49db846656d5e66496130925b\nparent 3fc4c012e3cd8b44a0167f854f7655976ff25806\nauthor Ferdinand Salis <mail@ferdinandsalis.com> 1781209524 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1781209524 +0200\n\nRemove Dependabot version updates and auto-merge workflow (#125)\n\nDependency updates are now handled deliberately (housecleaning passes +\nthe Security Audit workflow failing CI on moderate+ vulns). This stops\nthe weekly grouped PRs and removes the always-skipped auto-merge check\nfrom every CI run. Dependabot security alerts and security-update PRs\nstay enabled in repo settings as the early-warning layer.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqKxm0CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAACU4QAGUqb5AEsUtXBBq43qdvoTRz\nAuzDEz+bRDieKFhNLSagcyHJ3keT+yRddctvh0JnPrjqsMLAY4i8NE/3m/95CPDK\nJBZAxlr9gSFrszQxzC1r2qtSdllIIjSfBzhsVl9kcEb3/mYtomkvpF6KtPu6KTnU\nX0Pd4TxDQwlQJvcb9u+ot1vWxWGfk2nREp94lHRg8NCn7MJCzEBysDro/o0e6OB7\n0cfCZ6PhttWAM88bdtj/tguGvIcxtRF+awkziq9Zrj0A0jNAyr73BXUOhAZjJxIK\ny2O9oneAI+U45z1zBUPqu7iap7ZNJMoHd7LSpofJGF+EkODWXud4Q+hLaxy1Zj27\ntM8y3fDSFFPj8k7dq5f80Qq6iZRgusJu28cK4KffcNd1rEBTMOI3MLF+ULkUbEL8\nJgxbeq/PyobiA+tr5L7zewPsPIgkOvf6wyAeIom2IedjjEERdbRmLXojOgSIlxo7\ndpjlIY5C1cagP14RIKMKocgojneF8J/5oNlz0EIL5rw++FhJMAR8tUmm+G+AbYiF\nK5u6eomx0Ju4qzbZ77VKSASnmDNAvfpAOROH2TpDjpSob9VGGqUMFr2Lus7r/7UL\ng17gdvvaTdrr0kz2hAWd8WBEWLaTtHS2zIs4dKTP5y/zd750U6YtsspSkwbuBLRa\niXjGlfStCCc5PUoch5nW\n=2gjK\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-11T20:25:24Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.co