Z","email":"mail@ferdinandsalis.com","name":"Ferdinand Salis"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-11T18:37:21Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Own the lint config: ESLint 10, drop @epic-web/config (#123)\n\n* Own the lint config: ESLint 10, drop @epic-web/config\n\nepic-config''s eslint+prettier lane is unmaintained (v2 moved to oxlint,\nv3 to oxfmt), and it pinned us to eslint 9. Fork the flat config in-repo\n(adapted from @epic-web/config, MIT) with direct plugin deps.\n\n- Verified rule parity via --print-config diff: only intentional losses\n  are the two epic-web custom rules (no-manual-dispose,\n  prefer-dispose-in-tests)\n- Playwright rules now actually match our e2e layout (tests/*.spec.ts);\n  epic-config matched **/tests/e2e/** which never hit anything\n- ts-reset via direct @total-typescript/ts-reset dep (types/reset.d.ts)\n- eslint-plugin-react peer range tops out at eslint 9.7 but runs clean\n  on 10; only used for react/jsx-key\n\n* Format repo with prettier (incl. Tailwind 4 class ordering)\n\nnpm run format hadn''t run in a while; 47 files, mostly class-name\nre-sorting from prettier-plugin-tailwindcss 0.8''s TW4 order.\n\n* Rename aufnahme query file to drop leading space in filename","tree":{"sha":"e4652afa8487a42741f564eefd5a84b081b67e54","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ferdinandsalis/walz/git/trees/e4652afa8487a42741f564eefd5a84b081b67e54"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ferdinandsalis/walz/git/commits/e02a501437692b22a3ef1739a5d91c42ff28dbe7","verification":{"payload":"tree e4652afa8487a42741f564eefd5a84b081b67e54\nparent b3edc5bc86b2b2447ed237edda0d0f1dfcf375c2\nauthor Ferdinand Salis <mail@ferdinandsalis.com> 1781203041 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1781203041 +0200\n\nOwn the lint config: ESLint 10, drop @epic-web/config (#123)\n\n* Own the lint config: ESLint 10, drop @epic-web/config\n\nepic-config''s eslint+prettier lane is unmaintained (v2 moved to oxlint,\nv3 to oxfmt), and it pinned us to eslint 9. Fork the flat config in-repo\n(adapted from @epic-web/config, MIT) with direct plugin deps.\n\n- Verified rule parity via --print-config diff: only intentional losses\n  are the two epic-web custom rules (no-manual-dispose,\n  prefer-dispose-in-tests)\n- Playwright rules now actually match our e2e layout (tests/*.spec.ts);\n  epic-config matched **/tests/e2e/** which never hit anything\n- ts-reset via direct @total-typescript/ts-reset dep (types/reset.d.ts)\n- eslint-plugin-react peer range tops out at eslint 9.7 but runs clean\n  on 10; only used for react/jsx-key\n\n* Format repo with prettier (incl. Tailwind 4 class ordering)\n\nnpm run format hadn''t run in a while; 47 files, mostly class-name\nre-sorting from prettier-plugin-tailwindcss 0.8''s TW4 order.\n\n* Rename aufnahme query file to drop leading space in filename","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqKwBhCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA2FAQACPha2jexJT5fWRkpmnV0Uzl\nH9vEmNQHHvKZei2Uj5Z0WfMgZJ4TSzE2LQGiciMR4xgO7xyqeRLZDMnS50D+md+X\nNTJAiBJcWAU8EcwKIXNYGvl14jfV1nUep+IPYOC/bYwaB3f6jwXLgNuXNC6Rtjlo\nC8L7U/A8igTkYrkltfVJirm7AhkUKUi3P2eGsQUOqBb1p+52VXRvyn4cmOJ1U/xf\nn4DW4yL9E6JVZzW8/ldXBr2/WE0m0ez8wk5KlgLsHqFvXcnfkm++1atp8WBPK6ur\nXsdWvX5yknnpaEZk6oOqRnStNWj1bxEx9RQuqobJR5+nmEHgjRB/IigGZMCB36yq\nVsENyg+SSqvbSb5UicnOo8uB/WrQ1OrGGoL0kmf+2vcyHi+sv06xgz/8oBuk9JLS\n9HoStiXyEYRLVepr70mpopAOhibCcxEqGXU2RT7i9jIxrHQxNr2lvRi0SnI2YscH\nU4hXB2Z5mSbmnnzMq5YAv/JEcprB0S/peC13R1rcc4Rv71X+tEtbu7MqQ9qlv+Ms\n1AMO5eT063YmQyXCN+Ky15MojjhNpW7HHPpCef0uvJagX+Jgy7VgZUXjdot1R7jN\nQIwVHF4nAtw6KQeP8Y0kuH/Im61DKB7qh66ze+gb8hxdRgIfiSoUTYFNwaTGh8m6\nMEyefAKV1dCuePic6ds0\n=MC/5\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-11T18:37:22Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"h