l":"https://api.github.com/users/ferdinandsalis/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ferdinandsalis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ferdinandsalis/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ferdinandsalis","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ferdinandsalis/walz/commits/b3edc5bc86b2b2447ed237edda0d0f1dfcf375c2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-11T07:14:49Z","email":"mail@ferdinandsalis.com","name":"Ferdinand Salis"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-11T07:14:49Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Add react-is as a direct dependency to fix production crash (#122)\n\n@sanity/ui peer-depends on react-is but legacy-peer-deps=true means npm\nnever auto-installs it. Locally an invalid react-is@17 hoisted from a\ndevDependency masked this; the Docker image prunes dev deps, so any\nrequest touching the Studio chunk crashed the server with\nERR_MODULE_NOT_FOUND and the Fly deploy failed health checks.\nVerified: /studio serves 200 on a local production build.","tree":{"sha":"fc4e462a79d57e7111227b21a7eadaab343417d0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ferdinandsalis/walz/git/trees/fc4e462a79d57e7111227b21a7eadaab343417d0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ferdinandsalis/walz/git/commits/b3edc5bc86b2b2447ed237edda0d0f1dfcf375c2","verification":{"payload":"tree fc4e462a79d57e7111227b21a7eadaab343417d0\nparent 7ef196f204a490af19a36973f9917878d6f99d43\nauthor Ferdinand Salis <mail@ferdinandsalis.com> 1781162089 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1781162089 +0200\n\nAdd react-is as a direct dependency to fix production crash (#122)\n\n@sanity/ui peer-depends on react-is but legacy-peer-deps=true means npm\nnever auto-installs it. Locally an invalid react-is@17 hoisted from a\ndevDependency masked this; the Docker image prunes dev deps, so any\nrequest touching the Studio chunk crashed the server with\nERR_MODULE_NOT_FOUND and the Fly deploy failed health checks.\nVerified: /studio serves 200 on a local production build.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqKmBpCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAfu0QAJtTZizaKCKVZv9pXpYxdKyw\n4wjTW/I48rSYVh1qfEz183mZNg79ItgHLwFVICD9RWg5YslwjNPJBmU1ExDiJdEb\nqRtF5aZWko0QbdeVrR40wg80xDXrUohL5pv2vUBSp5kSfflX2X9BwLYuwf1+KJFl\nzll3OwpiR82mBEacwXcNz9m/Slo7Poh+L8Bk2tYcgRyvp8aMTJVMVKCQoI16JDl4\nv3pkvoCeX+bPGyHp/TAUT3pmSNx1wzj8klrSCOyQbAJnBUIy19YdxGAx4hI/ooTm\nSNiHLrp1wah7jS2ALL5jKEck97HUNvvuWpsarm1wP3IxkXN8a42SNAKjCxHQvRFy\nT0hl6wJGS9IkABCm1j2vcqq+4fdw8MeRVB/d2MJiCDX48dvtDrB6DYP7LOJ9vkjS\nU5zMG8rQoNsUztqXza4wQjulvWWrxu3m18EXqiD8RB5s2o2SU55D2m/EyVT61JDw\noDBqYmc1uSVHFVKx4Q/naeh+MsB07Vq4Pb7dXwTsaraxog3gzWuseTke+gVnBz7H\nvpc1g0fweaHa/tNY6cqU9Fz05ZwgjcUftAp3xeD5B+8GFChfv4OMz7g/bVtS/E19\n7JSdvqBN5fB1c7H1Y4uEAT4NlSyj9Q9MnXJgIGdWV0UwWyjKDqoesd/SAPp3XcX6\nB8MT+D09FLfTiKzJoXSl\n=Dt/5\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-11T07:14:50Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ferdinandsalis/walz/commit/b3edc5bc86b2b2447ed237edda0d0f1dfcf375c2","node_id":"C_kwDOKP_7ZtoAKGIzZWRjNWJjODZiMmIyNDQ3ZWQyMzdlZGRhMGQwZjFkZmNmMzc1YzI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ferdinandsalis/walz/commit/7ef196f204a490af19a36973f9917878d6f99d43","sha":"7ef196f204a490af19a36973f9917878d6f99d43","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ferdinandsalis/walz/commits/7ef196f204a490af19a36973f9917878d6f99d43"}],"sha":"b3edc5bc86b2b2447ed237edda0d0f1dfcf375c2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ferdinandsalis/walz/commits/b3edc5bc86b2b2447ed237edda0d0f1dfcf375c2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/340520?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ferdinandsalis/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ferdinandsalis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ferdinandsalis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ferdinandsalis/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ferdinandsalis","id":340520,"login":"ferdinandsalis","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0MDUyMA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ferdinandsalis/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ferdinandsalis/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ferdinandsalis/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ferdinandsalis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ferdinandsalis/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ferdinandsalis","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ferdinandsalis/walz/commits/7ef196f204a490af19a36973f9917878d6f99d43/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-11T06:52:45Z","email":"mail@ferdinandsalis.com","name":"Ferdinand Salis"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-11T06:52:45Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Housecleaning: deps current, audit zero, TS 6, Vite 8, Tailwind 4 (#121)\n\n* Add dependency housecleaning plan\n\n* Update dependencies within semver ranges\n\n~45 packages: react-router 7.13->7.17, sanity 5.13->5.31, sentry 10.42->10.57,\nreact 19.2.7, vitest 4.1, zod 4.4, radix/otel patches, etc.\nnpm audit: 41 vulns (2 critical, 12 high) -> 15 moderate, 0 critical/high.\n\n* Bump setup-node, upload-artifact, github-script off Node 20 runtimes\n\nGitHub forces Node 24 for actions on June 16, 2026; these were the\nflagged Node 20 actions. setup-node v5+ auto-caching does not apply\n(no packageManager field in package.json).\n\n* Align type packages: @types/react(-dom) 19, @types/node 24, esbuild 0.28\n\nReact 19 removed the global JSX namespace; use React.JSX / imported JSX type.\n\n* Clear npm audit backlog with scoped overrides\n\nRemaining 15 moderates were two advisories in the sanity tree (js-yaml\nprototype pollution via @vercel/frameworks, uuid bounds check via\n@sanity/uuid and typeid-js) with no fixed upstream release even in\nsanity 5.31. Scoped overrides force the patched transitives without\ntouching anything else. npm audit: 0 vulnerabilities.\n\n* TypeScript 6\n\n* Vite 8\n\nRolldown-based: rename build.rollupOptions to rolldownOptions.\nVerified: typecheck, vitest, build, dev server, full Playwright e2e.\n\n* Migrate to Tailwind CSS 4\n\n- Official codemod: CSS-first @theme config (custom screens, full text\n  scale, shadcn-style color tokens, accordion keyframes preserved),\n  utility renames across 20 template files, tailwind.config.ts removed\n- @tailwindcss/vite plugin instead of PostCSS (the postcss pipeline\n  failed to resolve @import under Vite 8)\n- tailwind-merge 3 (theme keys colors->color, borderRadius->radius),\n  tailwindcss-radix 4; container-queries plugin dropped (core in v4)\n- Removed stray borderRadius-in-colors junk the codemod faithfully copied\n\nVerified: typecheck, vitest, lint, build, token presence in built CSS,\nfull Playwright e2e. Visual review pending.\n\n* Clear all lint warnings and deprecated sanity image-url import\n\n- Delete dead AdmissionTimeline component (unused since #103 replaced\n  it with the infobox; lives on in git history) and its icon imports\n- error-boundary.test: drop redundant beforeEach (restoreMocks is on),\n  inline per-test setup, remove import() type annotation\n- @sanity/image-url: named createImageUrlBuilder export","tree":{"sha":"a3901e551abfd95ca41db6ba7d8a6f5be14289af","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ferdinandsalis/walz/git/trees/a3901e551abfd95ca41db6ba7d8a6f5be14289af"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ferdinandsalis/walz/git/commits/7ef196f204a490af19a36973f9917878d6f99d43","verification":{"payload":"tree a3901e551abfd95ca41db6ba7d8a6f5be14289af\nparent 8f246c4e6b42859a2c1cd1a150f60d08198282f7\nauthor Ferdinand Salis <mail@ferdinandsalis.com> 1781160765 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1781160765 +0200\n\nHousecleaning: deps current, audit zero, TS 6, Vite 8, Tailwind 4 (#121)\n\n* Add dependency housecleaning plan\n\n* Update dependencies within semver ranges\n\n~45 packages: react-router 7.13->7.17, sanity 5.13->5.31, sentry 10.42->10.57,\nreact 19.2.7, vitest 4.1, zod 4.4, radix/otel patches, etc.\nnpm audit: 41 vulns (2 critical, 12 high) -> 15 moderate, 0 critical/high.\n\n* Bump setup-node, upload-artifact, github-script off Node 20 runtimes\n\nGitHub forces Node 24 for actions on June 16, 2026; these were the\nflagged Node 20 actions. setup-node v5+ auto-caching does not apply\n(no packageManager field in package.json).\n\n* Align type packages: @types/react(-dom) 19, @types/node 24, esbuild 0.28\n\nReact 19 removed the global JSX namespace; use React.JSX / imported JSX type.\n\n* Clear npm audit backlog with scoped overrides\n\nRemaining 15 moderates were two advisories in the sanity tree (js-yaml\nprototype pollution via @vercel/frameworks, uuid bounds check via\n@sanity/uuid and typeid-js) with no fixed upstream release even in\nsanity 5.31. Scoped overrides force the patched transitives without\ntouching anything else. npm audit: 0 vulnerabilities.\n\n* TypeScript 6\n\n* Vite 8\n\nRolldown-based: rename build.rollupOptions to rolldownOptions.\nVerified: typecheck, vitest, build, dev server, full Playwright e2e.\n\n* Migrate to Tailwind CSS 4\n\n- Official codemod: CSS-first @theme config (custom screens, full text\n  scale, shadcn-style color tokens, accordion keyframes preserved),\n  utility renames across 20 template files, tailwind.config.ts removed\n- @tailwindcss/vite plugin instead of PostCSS (the postcss pipeline\n  failed to resolve @import under Vite 8)\n- tailwind-merge 3 (theme keys colors->color, borderRadius->radius),\n  tailwindcss-radix 4; container-queries plugin dropped (core in v4)\n- Removed stray borderRadius-in-colors junk the codemod faithfully copied\n\nVerified: typecheck, vitest, lint, build, token presence in built CSS,\nfull Playwright e2e. Visual review pending.\n\n* Clear all lint warnings and deprecated sanity image-url import\n\n- Delete dead AdmissionTimeline component (unused since #103 replaced\n  it with the infobox; lives on in git history) and its icon imports\n- error-boundary.test: drop redundant beforeEach (restoreMocks is on),\n  inline per-test setup, remove import() type annotation\n- @sanity/image-url: named createImageUrlBuilder export","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqKls9CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAF2cQAGt92AhY7wvj5zbRMKFmrLgi\ncideK4T8yZF4sARKma6hKOMKh4EygJATdvQSE1+KSyTq6z5D1UMQ/UfFEnHXRhka\nISr9KaJYHY0IEMM4na98nNKjBTvcrP9HKuQOh9oa3vBAZqvywoKTq0JRowFQU+3Q\ncuySf0MroU6kJbC+WSuBIi6txo5VjVIK8pK0Y8jgKQcP86+rcRfwABKSMbxFFYmx\ns5VgqdqWe4qbT+c1Xexr+Xu3jygh5SQV/S1VFxMRL3NC9rLp0HfjY4weor62PEkQ\nNzuxuz02EL87jMaAi8e875/V6q7/a9ohBqorCxsC9uB7em/qESTE9fw40lYjgVYP\neuZgJAG1o+pxPSCLhD6oKRtH+rNv+WwfcHdnYEBy1G6Z9sgxokadQQ+kObEMJf/1\n1ky/2sX6gigY3aTKf7lk9Nzr9bcigk5QCo+Sn18JxZz3ITRGyjELzE4FutwFE/cd\nx3oIJVSgYBPEIv+I+UDxyVCsXMc4LznUMGwFfqP6e3d3Nhx35LiYUDwNXqpJfG