toSelector component using useFormValue hook\n- Store photo _key instead of asset._ref in featuredPhoto field\n- Update selectFeaturedPhoto to match by _key\n- Make PhotoSchema optional fields nullable (.optional().nullable())\n- Explicitly project photo fields in GROQ queries (jahrgaenge, aktuelles, $year)\n- Update tests to validate _key-based selection","tree":{"sha":"d9bc7de764f2c653cadb02e4eeb78f77836757be","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ferdinandsalis/walz/git/trees/d9bc7de764f2c653cadb02e4eeb78f77836757be"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ferdinandsalis/walz/git/commits/a33bd4fb5ec8f32e68277eb98b2c3991326b36c0","verification":{"payload":"tree d9bc7de764f2c653cadb02e4eeb78f77836757be\nparent 21a80927ceebd1957ed4c58f8162ba69a2989c24\nauthor Ferdinand Salis-Samaden <mail@ferdinandsalis.com> 1762454357 +0100\ncommitter Ferdinand Salis-Samaden <mail@ferdinandsalis.com> 1762454357 +0100\n\nfeat: add dropdown selector for featured photo in Sanity Studio\n\nReplace manual asset reference copy/paste with intuitive dropdown picker\nthat displays photos sorted by date with year and motto labels. Switch\nfrom asset._ref to _key-based selection for more reliable referential\nintegrity. Update all GROQ queries to explicitly project photo fields\nincluding _key. Fix Zod schema to accept nullable optional fields\nmatching Sanity''s data model.\n\nChanges:\n- Add FeaturedPhotoSelector component using useFormValue hook\n- Store photo _key instead of asset._ref in featuredPhoto field\n- Update selectFeaturedPhoto to match by _key\n- Make PhotoSchema optional fields nullable (.optional().nullable())\n- Explicitly project photo fields in GROQ queries (jahrgaenge, aktuelles, $year)\n- Update tests to validate _key-based selection\n","reason":"unknown_key","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQIzBAABCAAdFiEEQx4w7QBPbqf+GZq218PnjGbiqPYFAmkM61UACgkQ18PnjGbi\nqPZyVQ/+Pp8WXF7stVwcY9e4914PEQhGStzUljsNPCDFV0BI3dkIfVK9oGrQackj\nOf0n/ILVzqGvI812wSthO9vWWTLZj0Knfqqbqffdxf