","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ferdinandsalis/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ferdinandsalis","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ferdinandsalis/walz/commits/3c64fbaa72d9c24130c5bfef72c0685c9cb126b2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-06T11:57:39Z","email":"mail@ferdinandsalis.com","name":"Ferdinand Salis-Samaden"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-06T11:57:39Z","email":"mail@ferdinandsalis.com","name":"Ferdinand Salis-Samaden"},"message":"fix: update featuredPhoto to work with Sanity''s string field schema\n\nThe featuredPhoto field now stores the asset _ref as a plain string instead of\na nested object structure. This aligns with Sanity''s schema definition where\nthe field uses a dynamic dropdown populated from the photos array.\n\nChanges:\n- Updated GROQ queries to fetch featuredPhoto as a string\n- Updated Zod schemas to validate as string instead of nested object\n- Updated selectFeaturedPhoto helper to accept string ref parameter\n- Updated tests to use string refs instead of objects\n- Added type assertion for Sanity''s dynamic list function","tree":{"sha":"7a04b582c6721bd58eec01d38766ced5b86a4b72","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ferdinandsalis/walz/git/trees/7a04b582c6721bd58eec01d38766ced5b86a4b72"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ferdinandsalis/walz/git/commits/3c64fbaa72d9c24130c5bfef72c0685c9cb126b2","verification":{"payload":"tree 7a04b582c6721bd58eec01d38766ced5b86a4b72\nparent d2e422cf278dd38f2e6db0ea2e04016fd5d5a381\nauthor Ferdinand Salis-Samaden <mail@ferdinandsalis.com> 1762430259 +0100\ncommitter Ferdinand Salis-Samaden <mail@ferdinandsalis.com> 1762430259 +0100\n\nfix: update featuredPhoto to work with Sanity''s string field schema\n\nThe featuredPhoto field now stores the asset _ref as a plain string instead of\na nested object structure. This aligns with Sanity''s schema definition where\nthe field uses a dynamic dropdown 