ame":"GitHub"},"observedAt":"2026-10-08T18:12:28.486Z","repositoryId":689820074,"sha":"a4bedec645cb65163df00754e5b98b1f0a81a8de"},{"author":{"account":{"login":"nu-xin","providerType":"User"},"email":"nu-xin@qq.com","name":"nu-xin"},"authoredDate":"2026-03-01T06:06:08Z","committedDate":"2026-03-01T06:06:08Z","committer":{"account":{"login":"nu-xin","providerType":"User"},"email":"nu-xin@qq.com","name":"nu-xin"},"observedAt":"2026-10-08T18:12:28.486Z","repositoryId":689820074,"sha":"4af1501ba2114dcc965c810d811345e06732ccf6"}],"observedAt":"2026-10-08T18:12:28.486Z","raw":[{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5526525?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wmzy","id":5526525,"login":"wmzy","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1MjY1MjU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-router/core/commits/7228e1d3b7edfc87f4eefad386b9f53b6d0a456a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-07T00:27:33Z","email":"1256573276@qq.com","name":"wmzy"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-07T00:27:33Z","email":"1256573276@qq.com","name":"wmzy"},"message":"feat(core): let redirects replace the current history entry\n\nA guard redirect may now return a RedirectTarget object ({path,\nreplace: true}) in addition to a plain path string. The last hop of a\nchain decides both the terminal location and the commit geometry, so a\nlogin guard can keep the protected URL out of history.\n\n- types: add RedirectTarget; widen BaseRoute.redirect and\n  BaseRoute.beforeLoad to the string-or-target union.\n- router: fold each hop''s replace instruction into ResolvedEntry.replace;\n  navigate commits through navigateEntry, which dispatches the terminal\n  commit to the replace bookkeeping when the flag is set (the debug\n  chain keeps the gesture''s ''push'' action, listen sees ''replace'').\n  Extract pushOnResolved/replaceOnResolved so both commit paths share\n  the same stack-window bookkeeping as pushEntry/replaceEntry.\n- docs: README (EN/ZH) redirect section; 9 behavioural tests plus 3\n  RedirectTarget type tests.","tree":{"sha":"ee62213af121024cccc02088beb272d641f04305","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-router/core/git/trees/ee62213af121024cccc02088beb272d641f04305"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-router/core/git/commits/7228e1d3b7edfc87f4eefad386b9f53b6d0a456a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5526525?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wmzy","id":5526525,"login":"wmzy","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1MjY1MjU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/native-router/core/commit/7228e1d3b7edfc87f4eefad386b9f53b6d0a456a","node_id":"C_kwDOKR3RqtoAKDcyMjhlMWQzYjdlZGZjODdmNGVlZmFkMzg2YjlmNTNiNmQwYTQ1NmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/native-router/core/commit/da0daf3748500c3df58b41a58cf8407c10dc570a","sha":"da0daf3748500c3df58b41a58cf8407c10dc570a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-router/core/commits/da0daf3748500c3df58b41a58cf8407c10dc570a"}],"sha":"7228e1d3b7edfc87f4eefad386b9f53b6d0a456a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-router/core/commits/7228e1d3b7edfc87f4eefad386b9f53b6d0a456a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5526525?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wmzy","id":5526525,"login":"wmzy","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1MjY1MjU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-router/core/commits/da0daf3748500c3df58b41a58cf8407c10dc570a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-06T01:52:54Z","email":"1256573276@qq.com","name":"wmzy"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T01:52:54Z","email":"1256573276@qq.com","name":"wmzy"},"message":"fix(core): drop the preload cache and abort in-flight preloads in invalidate\n\ninvalidate() only nulled the viewStack snapshots; resolved (guard-passed,\nloader-settled) preload entries survived within their TTL and could still\ncommit via preload()/PrefetchLink without re-running guards — an account\nswitch (the documented invalidate use case) could serve the previous\naccount''s resolution on a forward commit, the same staleness the viewStack\nhalf already guards against on back POPs. In-flight preloads are aborted\nwith the same semantics the concurrency bound''s FIFO eviction uses:\nbackground noise nobody observes.","tree":{"sha":"13e15f8375db596c922ad1833b6b13ca0f9bd2dc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-router/core/git/trees/13e15f8375db596c922ad1833b6b13ca0f9bd2dc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-router/core/git/commits/da0daf3748500c3df58b41a58cf8407c10dc570a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5526525?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wmzy","id":5526525,"login":"wmzy","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1MjY1MjU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/native-router/core/commit/da0daf3748500c3df58b41a58cf8407c10dc570a","node_id":"C_kwDOKR3RqtoAKGRhMGRhZjM3NDg1MDBjM2RmNThiNDFhNThjZjg0MDdjMTBkYzU3MGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/native-router/core/commit/b04db583b3d1b702c56b476b24807cc6a4709ac3","sha":"b04db583b3d1b702c56b476b24807cc6a4709ac3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-router/core/commits/b04db583b3d1b702c56b476b24807cc6a4709ac3"}],"sha":"da0daf3748500c3df58b41a58cf8407c10dc570a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-router/core/commits/da0daf3748500c3df58b41a58cf8407c10dc570a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5526525?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wmzy","id":5526525,"login":"wmzy","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1MjY1MjU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-router/core/commits/b04db583b3d1b702c56b476b24807cc6a4709ac3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-05T00:41:00Z","email":"1256573276@qq.com","name":"wmzy"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-05T00:41:00Z","email":"1256573276@qq.com","name":"wmzy"},"message":"fix(core): keep the coerced param when a deeper schema-less level re-declares the same raw binding\n\nThe per-level params accumulation in resolveEntry spread each level''s\nraw string params over the accumulated map before the level''s schema\nran, so a shallower schema''s coerced output was clobbered back to the\nraw string whenever a deeper level re-declared the same name — the\ndocumented limitation.\n\nThe merge now tracks the raw binding each key''s schema output was\nvalidated against: a deeper schema-less level re-declaring a same-name\nsegment with the SAME raw value keeps the coerced value; a different\nraw value is a new binding and the deeper string wins (deep-over-\nshallow on raw params, unchanged); a schema-declaring level re-binds\nits own segments to their raw strings so its own schema coerces the\nURL-side value, exactly as before.","tree":{"sha":"9a8fc717bc746d9cb39e943553880d7e8b0d77f1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-router/core/git/trees/9a8fc717bc746d9cb39e943553880d7e8b0d77f1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-router/core/git/commits/b04db583b3d1b702c56b476b24807cc6a4709ac3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5526525?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wmzy","id":5526525,"login":"wmzy","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1MjY1MjU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/native-router/core/commit/b04db583b3d1b702c56b476b24807cc6a4709ac3","node_id":"C_kwDOKR3RqtoAKGIwNGRiNTgzYjNkMWI3MDJjNTZiNDc2YjI0ODA3Y2M2YTQ3MDlhYzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/native-router/core/commit/b19a8aea728c722d97071d48bf58c321b6172b84","sha":"b19a8aea728c722d97071d48bf58c321b6172b84","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-router/core/commits/b19a8aea728c722d97071d48bf58c321b6172b84"}],"sha":"b04db583b3d1b702c56b476b24807cc6a4709ac3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-router/core/commits/b04db583b3d1b702c56b476b24807cc6a4709ac3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5526525?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wmzy","id":5526525,"login":"wmzy","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1MjY1MjU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-router/core/commits/b19a8aea728c722d97071d48bf58c321b6172b84/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-05T00:34:23Z","email":"1256573276@qq.com","name":"wmzy"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-05T00:34:23Z","email":"1256573276@qq.com","name":"wmzy"},"message":"fix(core): validate the target search against declared schemas on the searchDeps fast path\n\nThe searchDeps fast path (unchanged declared projection -> re-serve the\ncurrent view snapshot) reused the snapshot without any input-side\nvalidation, so an invalid value of an undeclared key silently landed in\nthe URL — a limitation the docs owned with no mechanism guarding it.\n\nreusableEntry now runs every matched level''s declared search schema\n(parseSearchInput -> schema, the same input parseSearch feeds it) on the\ntarget''s raw search before re-serving. A rejection — or an async schema,\nwhose verdict cannot be known synchronously — abandons the fast path, so\nthe full resolution re-parses the search and surfaces the SearchError\nthrough its normal error channel (guard/data phase -> errorHandler)\ninstead of committing an invalid value. An async search schema therefore\nopts its chain out of the fast path entirely.","tree":{"sha":"3b9cc6a68779c0fbd5e7501b66632ab52ee0641c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-router/core/git/trees/3b9cc6a68779c0fbd5e7501b66632ab52ee0641c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-router/core/git/commits/b19a8aea728c722d97071d48bf58c321b6172b84","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5526525?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wmzy","id":5526525,"login":"wmzy","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1MjY1MjU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/native-router/core/commit/b19a8aea728c722d97071d48bf58c321b6172b84","node_id":"C_kwDOKR3RqtoAKGIxOWE4YWVhNzI4YzcyMmQ5NzA3MWQ0OGJmNThjMzIxYjYxNzJiODQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/native-router/core/commit/e445e8e6309e3c2d9469729d51e855bb939e17dc","sha":"e445e8e6309e3c2d9469729d51e855bb939e17dc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-router/core/commits/e445e8e6309e3c2d9469729d51e855bb939e17dc"}],"sha":"b19a8aea728c722d97071d48bf58c321b6172b84","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-router/core/commits/b19a8aea728c722d97071d48bf58c321b6172b84"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5526525?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wmzy","id":5526525,"login":"wmzy","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1MjY1MjU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-router/core/commits/e445e8e6309e3c2d9469729d51e855bb939e17dc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-04T10:10:58Z","email":"1256573276@qq.com","name":"wmzy"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-04T10:10:58Z","email":"1256573276@qq.com","name":"wmzy"},"message":"feat(core): add the onDebug/getDebugInfo observability surface\n\nA minimal, opt-in observation plane for DevTool-style consumers:\n\n- onDebug(listener) on every create()d router (standalone function too)\n  emits the navigation lifecycle: nav-start / nav-commit / nav-cancel /\n  nav-supersede / nav-error, each with the action (push/replace/pop),\n  the relevant target path and epoch-ms timing. nav-start reports the\n  requested target, nav-commit the terminal location guards redirected\n  to; a POP served from the viewStack snapshot emits a lone nav-commit\n  with replay: true and duration: 0 — the replay-vs-re-resolve flag.\n- getDebugInfo() snapshots the current location, history index, the\n  session window depth/base, the held view snapshot count and the\n  in-flight chain; works with or without listeners.\n- Purely observational: a throwing listener is swallowed, and with no\n  listener the per-navigation bookkeeping is a couple of property\n  writes — existing behavior unchanged (162 tests green).","tree":{"sha":"593f34a0aeb45dc9a718fc04f75c3af510f0071f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-router/core/git/trees/593f34a0aeb45dc9a718fc04f75c3af510f0071f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-router/core/git/commits/e445e8e6309e3c2d9469729d51e855bb939e17dc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5526525?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wmzy","id":5526525,"login":"wmzy","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1MjY1MjU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/native-router/core/commit/e445e8e6309e3c2d9469729d51e855bb939e17dc","node_id":"C_kwDOKR3RqtoAKGU0NDVlOGU2MzA5ZTNjMmQ5NDY5NzI5ZDUxZTg1NWJiOTM5ZTE3ZGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/native-router/core/commit/90c1aa55832a4688ef4a9bedc9e6a47377ddfe27","sha":"90c1aa55832a4688ef4a9bedc9e6a47377ddfe27","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-router/core/commits/90c1aa55832a4688ef4a9bedc9e6a47377ddfe27"}],"sha":"e445e8e6309e3c2d9469729d51e855bb939e17dc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-router/core/commits/e445e8e6309e3c2d9469729d51e855bb939e17dc"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5526525?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wmzy","id":5526525,"login":"wmzy","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1MjY1MjU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-router/core/commits/90c1aa55832a4688ef4a9bedc9e6a47377ddfe27/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-03T23:32:21Z","email":"1256573276@qq.com","name":"wmzy"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-03T23:32:21Z","email":"1256573276@qq.com","name":"wmzy"},"message":"fix(core): reject a cancelled or superseded navigation instead of parking it forever\n\n被取消/被取代的 navigate() 旧语义是返回的 promise 永不 settle（currentGuard\n里以 cancelPromise() 停车），而被 blocker 否决的导航却立即 resolve——两种\n\"没有到达目标\"的场景对 await 的调用方行为不一致：前者把调用方永久悬挂，\n注释也自认这一点。悬挂比失败更糟：调用方既拿不到结果，也无法感知失败并\n清理。\n\n现在 createCurrentGuard 登记每条在飞链的 reject 句柄与错误工厂，新链注册\n或 cancel() 时立即（eagerly）以新导出的 NavigationCancelledError（携带被\n丢弃目标的提交路径形态 `to`）拒绝它们——不等被中止的解析自行 settle，\n守卫完全无视 abort signal 永不返回时 await 方也不再悬挂。vetoed 仍然正常\nresolve：否决是用户说不，属正常完成；被取代/取消是这条链的失败，二者由此\n区分。\n\n配套调整：commitBase 的 catch 对 NavigationCancelledError 跳过 in-flight\n标记与 onLoadingChange(''rejected'') 的清理——它们属于丢弃方（cancel() 自\n清，取代链自设），晚到的拒绝不得覆写赢家的状态；被取代链 late settle 的\n结果照旧丢弃。README 中英文的 never settles 契约、错误清单与 navigate/\ncancel/setBlocker 的 JSDoc 同步改写。\n\n即发即忘的调用点需挂 no-op catch（react 绑定的 Link/TypedLink/use-blocker/\nuse-setSearch/PrefetchLink 本就全部已挂）；库内无依赖旧语义的调用方。","tree":{"sha":"307e02a3ed893017ef9a8a9185f4dfaf114cbe17","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-router/core/git/trees/307e02a3ed893017ef9a8a9185f4dfaf114cbe17"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-router/core/git/commits/90c1aa55832a4688ef4a9bedc9e6a47377ddfe27","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5526525?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wmzy","id":5526525,"login":"wmzy","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1MjY1MjU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/native-router/core/commit/90c1aa55832a4688ef4a9bedc9e6a47377ddfe27","node_id":"C_kwDOKR3RqtoAKDkwYzFhYTU1ODMyYTQ2ODhlZjRhOWJlZGM5ZTZhNDczNzdkZGZlMjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/native-router/core/commit/62c08108c1c89c5230f0ab51a031f8476f85a82a","sha":"62c08108c1c89c5230f0ab51a031f8476f85a82a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-router/core/commits/62c08108c1c89c5230f0ab51a031f8476f85a82a"}],"sha":"90c1aa55832a4688ef4a9bedc9e6a47377ddfe27","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-router/core/commits/90c1aa55832a4688ef4a9bedc9e6a47377ddfe27"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5526525?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wmzy","id":5526525,"login":"wmzy","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1MjY1MjU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-router/core/commits/62c08108c1c89c5230f0ab51a031f8476f85a82a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-03T02:37:32Z","email":"1256573276@qq.com","name":"wmzy"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-03T02:37:32Z","email":"1256573276@qq.com","name":"wmzy"},"message":"docs(core): document the route-level context declaration and its merge semantics","tree":{"sha":"b5ccbff1ffda11af919100176ff4d2dfd82eeaa8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-router/core/git/trees/b5ccbff1ffda11af919100176ff4d2dfd82eeaa8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-router/core/git/commits/62c08108c1c89c5230f0ab51a031f8476f85a82a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5526525?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wmzy","id":5526525,"login":"wmzy","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1MjY1MjU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/native-router/core/commit/62c08108c1c89c5230f0ab51a031f8476f85a82a","node_id":"C_kwDOKR3RqtoAKDYyYzA4MTA4YzFjODljNTIzMGYwYWI1MWEwMzFmODQ3NmY4NWE4MmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/native-router/core/commit/0c7a85d9ea9a5799e5a2a8bb8f17bee58dac91fc","sha":"0c7a85d9ea9a5799e5a2a8bb8f17bee58dac91fc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-router/core/commits/0c7a85d9ea9a5799e5a2a8bb8f17bee58dac91fc"}],"sha":"62c08108c1c89c5230f0ab51a031f8476f85a82a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-router/core/commits/62c08108c1c89c5230f0ab51a031f8476f85a82a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5526525?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wmzy","id":5526525,"login":"wmzy","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1MjY1MjU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-router/core/commits/0c7a85d9ea9a5799e5a2a8bb8f17bee58dac91fc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-03T02:36:22Z","email":"1256573276@qq.com","name":"wmzy"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-03T02:36:34Z","email":"1256573276@qq.com","name":"wmzy"},"message":"fix(core): bound initHistoryStack warm-up fan-out at 4 concurrent resolves\n\nRefreshing a full serialized window (up to maxStackDepth, 100 entries)\nfanned every entry''s guards and loaders out at once through Promise.all,\nsaturating the network exactly when the page is already busy reloading.\nThe warm-up now runs through a simple FIFO pump bounded at 4 in-flight\nresolutions — the same rationale as preload''s bound, minus the aborting:\na warm-up has no winner to prioritize, queued entries simply wait their\nturn. A single failing entry degrades its slot to null (the POP lazy\nre-resolve path picks it up on landing) instead of rejecting the whole\nwarm-up, which previously left every slot unwarmed.","tree":{"sha":"70e1d37c1b09de1717bd58314970bdd3ef20daa3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-router/core/git/trees/70e1d37c1b09de1717bd58314970bdd3ef20daa3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-router/core/git/commits/0c7a85d9ea9a5799e5a2a8bb8f17bee58dac91fc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5526525?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wmzy","id":5526525,"login":"wmzy","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1MjY1MjU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/native-router/core/commit/0c7a85d9ea9a5799e5a2a8bb8f17bee58dac91fc","node_id":"C_kwDOKR3RqtoAKDBjN2E4NWQ5ZWE5YTU3OTllNWEyYThiYjhmMTdiZWU1OGRhYzkxZmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/native-router/core/commit/2f6723236c94af70631ed646c43934a553d26d4d","sha":"2f6723236c94af70631ed646c43934a553d26d4d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-router/core/commits/2f6723236c94af70631ed646c43934a553d26d4d"}],"sha":"0c7a85d9ea9a5799e5a2a8bb8f17bee58dac91fc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-router/core/commits/0c7a85d9ea9a5799e5a2a8bb8f17bee58dac91fc"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5526525?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wmzy","id":5526525,"login":"wmzy","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1MjY1MjU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-router/core/commits/2f6723236c94af70631ed646c43934a553d26d4d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-02T21:39:08Z","email":"1256573276@qq.com","name":"wmzy"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-02T21:39:08Z","email":"1256573276@qq.com","name":"wmzy"},"message":"feat(core): merge route-level context declarations into guard and view contexts\n\nA route may declare a `context` object. beforeLoad guards now receive\nthe instance context folded through the prefix''s route contexts — every\nancestor''s declaration plus their own, deeper levels winning on key\nconflicts, exactly how matched params accumulate — and resolveView (both\nthe guarded resolveEntry path and the one-shot resolve/initHistoryStack\npath) receives the fold over the whole matched chain. Frameworks\nre-derive the per-level prefix for their data loaders.\n\nNon-breaking by construction: levels without a context (or a null one)\ncontribute nothing, and tables that never declare route contexts keep\nthe exact instance-context value — no copy, byte-for-byte the old\nbehavior.","tree":{"sha":"16694f50ef2b8abefc9bd8ff46c0caed86609ffd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-router/core/git/trees/16694f50ef2b8abefc9bd8ff46c0caed86609ffd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-router/core/git/commits/2f6723236c94af70631ed646c43934a553d26d4d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5526525?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wmzy","id":5526525,"login":"wmzy","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1MjY1MjU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/native-router/core/commit/2f6723236c94af70631ed646c43934a553d26d4d","node_id":"C_kwDOKR3RqtoAKDJmNjcyMzIzNmM5NGFmNzA2MzFlZDY0NmM0MzkzNGE1NTNkMjZkNGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/native-router/core/commit/9b80199bf56bdc28836bb8d47bd8961347577dd8","sha":"9b80199bf56bdc28836bb8d47bd8961347577dd8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-router/core/commits/9b80199bf56bdc28836bb8d47bd8961347577dd8"}],"sha":"2f6723236c94af70631ed646c43934a553d26d4d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-router/core/commits/2f6723236c94af70631ed646c43934a553d26d4d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5526525?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wmzy","id":5526525,"login":"wmzy","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1MjY1MjU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-router/core/commits/9b80199bf56bdc28836bb8d47bd8961347577dd8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-02T21:36:44Z","email":"1256573276@qq.com","name":"wmzy"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-02T21:36:44Z","email":"1256573276@qq.com","name":"wmzy"},"message":"fix(core): return undefined from getParams for out-of-window slots\n\ngetParams silently returned {} when the current entry''s slot falls\noutside the restored location window — an out-of-band \"params unknown\"\nstate indistinguishable from a legitimately param-less route. It now\nreturns undefined for out-of-window slots (the location is unknown to\nthe session, so callers can fall back or re-match); a path that matches\nno route still yields {}, which is a real answer about a known location.","tree":{"sha":"cb0c642107fd96f2a66c914bda23cbd6ab3f672a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-router/core/git/trees/cb0c642107fd96f2a66c914bda23cbd6ab3f672a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-router/core/git/commits/9b80199bf56bdc28836bb8d47bd8961347577dd8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5526525?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wmzy","id":5526525,"login":"wmzy","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1MjY1MjU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/native-router/core/commit/9b80199bf56bdc28836bb8d47bd8961347577dd8","node_id":"C_kwDOKR3RqtoAKDliODAxOTliZjU2YmRjMjg4MzZiYjhkNDdiZDg5NjEzNDc1NzdkZDg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/native-router/core/commit/bd547f67604fde25baf5aafa373f2e0a8abca504","sha":"bd547f67604fde25baf5aafa373f2e0a8abca504","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-router/core/commits/bd547f67604fde25baf5aafa373f2e0a8abca504"}],"sha":"9b80199bf56bdc28836bb8d47bd8961347577dd8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-router/core/commits/9b80199bf56bdc28836bb8d47bd8961347577dd8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5526525?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wmzy","id":5526525,"login":"wmzy","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1MjY1MjU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-router/core/commits/bd547f67604fde25baf5aafa373f2e0a8abca504/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-02T21:35:45Z","email":"1256573276@qq.com","name":"wmzy"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-02T21:35:45Z","email":"1256573276@qq.com","name":"wmzy"},"message":"fix(core): restore the settled URL after a zero-delta vetoed POP\n\nA vetoed same-index POP (between stateless external entries sharing one\nstate index) has no counter-go to rewind with — go(0) goes nowhere — so\nthe address bar stayed stranded on the vetoed target forever while the\nrouter stacks and the rendered view kept the current entry. The veto now\nrestores the settled location with a history.replace (re-serializing the\nsession window into the entry), and the restore''s own synchronous REPLACE\nlanding takes the same no-cancel re-announce branch a rewind POP gets:\nan in-flight chain survives the veto untouched.\n\nTrade-off (noted inline): unlike a rewind, the restore rewrites the\nlanded entry''s state — intended, since the vetoed target never belonged\nto the session.","tree":{"sha":"c5ff115d473138abbc63f108d59a6992de34912c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-router/core/git/trees/c5ff115d473138abbc63f108d59a6992de34912c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-router/core/git/commits/bd547f67604fde25baf5aafa373f2e0a8abca504","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5526525?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wmzy","id":5526525,"login":"wmzy","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1MjY1MjU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/native-router/core/commit/bd547f67604fde25baf5aafa373f2e0a8abca504","node_id":"C_kwDOKR3RqtoAKGJkNTQ3ZjY3NjA0ZmRlMjViYWY1YWFmYTM3M2YyZTBhOGFiY2E1MDQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/native-router/core/commit/a4889e3d182e8f82ace282c95a96cbe129ebb0cd","sha":"a4889e3d182e8f82ace282c95a96cbe129ebb0cd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-router/core/commits/a4889e3d182e8f82ace282c95a96cbe129ebb0cd"}],"sha":"bd547f67604fde25baf5aafa373f2e0a8abca504","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-router/core/commits/bd547f67604fde25baf5aafa373f2e0a8abca504"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5526525?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wmzy","id":5526525,"login":"wmzy","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1MjY1MjU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-router/core/commits/a4889e3d182e8f82ace282c95a96cbe129ebb0cd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-02T21:34:20Z","email":"1256573276@qq.com","name":"wmzy"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-02T21:34:20Z","email":"1256573276@qq.com","name":"wmzy"},"message":"fix(core): let a user-driven commit win over a blocker rewind still in flight\n\nA vetoed POP rewinds with an async history.go(-delta); in real browsers\npopstate lands on a later task, so the rewind stays pending across the\nuser''s next navigation. The commit pipeline (commitBase, shared by\ncommit/commitReplace/navigate/refresh) now cancels the pending rewind\nthe moment a user-driven commit begins: the forward navigation wins and\nthe late rewind traversal walks the normal POP path — blockers re-asked\nwith the freshly committed entry as `from` — instead of being swallowed\nas a rewind landing that re-announces a stale snapshot at an index the\nrewind was never aimed at.\n\nRegression-tested with a browser-like history double whose go() lands on\na macrotask (memory history applies go synchronously and can never\nproduce the interleaving).","tree":{"sha":"e657e48ed5d1403eda1ceead0325e5010dc680a1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-router/core/git/trees/e657e48ed5d1403eda1ceead0325e5010dc680a1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-router/core/git/commits/a4889e3d182e8f82ace282c95a96cbe129ebb0cd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5526525?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wmzy","id":5526525,"login":"wmzy","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1MjY1MjU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/native-router/core/commit/a4889e3d182e8f82ace282c95a96cbe129ebb0cd","node_id":"C_kwDOKR3RqtoAKGE0ODg5ZTNkMTgyZThmODJhY2UyODJjOTVhOTZjYmUxMjllYmIwY2Q","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/native-router/core/commit/bd5571adba453221bf5ae610f6d8b63f643fc2e5","sha":"bd5571adba453221bf5ae610f6d8b63f643fc2e5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-router/core/commits/bd5571adba453221bf5ae610f6d8b63f643fc2e5"}],"sha":"a4889e3d182e8f82ace282c95a96cbe129ebb0cd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-router/core/commits/a4889e3d182e8f82ace282c95a96cbe129ebb0cd"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5526525?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wmzy","id":5526525,"login":"wmzy","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1MjY1MjU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-router/core/commits/bd5571adba453221bf5ae610f6d8b63f643fc2e5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-02T02:24:04Z","email":"1256573276@qq.com","name":"wmzy"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-02T02:24:04Z","email":"1256573276@qq.com","name":"wmzy"},"message":"feat(core): bound concurrent preloads with FIFO abort over preloadConcurrency\n\nPreloaded resolutions used to run under a signal that never aborted:\nhovering across a list of prefetch links accumulated unbounded requests\nthat only the 30s TTL could eventually reap.\n\nEach preload now owns an AbortController whose signal threads through\nresolveEntry into its guards and loaders (ctx.signal), and the router\ntracks in-flight preloads FIFO. Once more than preloadConcurrency (a\nnew create option, default 4) are in flight, the oldest is aborted:\nits guards/loaders observing the signal bail out, its cache slot is\ndropped so a later preload re-resolves fresh, and its failure is\nswallowed as background noise — no unhandled rejections. Flights leave\nthe window on their own once both the entry and its view task settle.\n\nA preload consumed by a committing navigation (commit/commitReplace\nhanding over preload()''s resolved task) is detached from the bound and\nnever aborted by it: its resolution is the navigation chain itself.\nSingle-link hover behavior is unchanged — one preload never reaches\nthe bound.","tree":{"sha":"decea01862d39e4628f8669e6a5b2a9355725a1c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-router/core/git/trees/decea01862d39e4628f8669e6a5b2a9355725a1c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-router/core/git/commits/bd5571adba453221bf5ae610f6d8b63f643fc2e5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5526525?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wmzy","id":5526525,"login":"wmzy","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1MjY1MjU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/native-router/core/commit/bd5571adba453221bf5ae610f6d8b63f643fc2e5","node_id":"C_kwDOKR3RqtoAKGJkNTU3MWFkYmE0NTMyMjFiZjVhZTYxMGY2ZDhiNjNmNjQzZmMyZTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/native-router/core/commit/a3ed26dcd5305879d8187bd843c4358380702b2e","sha":"a3ed26dcd5305879d8187bd843c4358380702b2e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-router/core/commits/a3ed26dcd5305879d8187bd843c4358380702b2e"}],"sha":"bd5571adba453221bf5ae610f6d8b63f643fc2e5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-router/core/commits/bd5571adba453221bf5ae610f6d8b63f643fc2e5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5526525?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wmzy","id":5526525,"login":"wmzy","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1MjY1MjU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-router/core/commits/a3ed26dcd5305879d8187bd843c4358380702b2e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-02T02:16:40Z","email":"1256573276@qq.com","name":"wmzy"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-02T02:16:40Z","email":"1256573276@qq.com","name":"wmzy"},"message":"fix(core): rank matched chains by specificity instead of first-declared-wins\n\nThe old matcher stopped at the first parent whose path prefix matched:\nwhen none of its children matched, it returned undefined for the whole\nlayer, so later siblings were never tried — [{path: ''/a'', children:\n[{path: ''/b''}]}, {path: ''/*rest''}] served /a/q a 404.\n\nmatch() now collects every matching chain and picks the most specific\none, TanStack-style: per path segment static text (10) outranks a\ndynamic :param (3), which outranks a splat *wildcard (2), and every\nsegment adds to the chain''s score, so longer chains outrank shorter\nones; equally specific chains fall back to declaration order.\n\nBehavior change for OVERLAPPING route tables only: they used to resolve\nby declaration order (first match wins), they now resolve by\nspecificity — /users/:id declared before /users/new no longer shadows\nthe static route. Non-overlapping tables match byte-for-byte as before.\n\nCompiled matchers are also memoized in a module-level WeakMap keyed by\nthe route object — every compile option (end = !route.children, the\ndecode option) is a constant of the route, so repeated match() calls no\nlonger recompile their regexes.","tree":{"sha":"e016d885756a1c2a888f9b043def89bb797f99e5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-router/core/git/trees/e016d885756a1c2a888f9b043def89bb797f99e5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-router/core/git/commits/a3ed26dcd5305879d8187bd843c4358380702b2e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5526525?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wmzy","id":5526525,"login":"wmzy","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1MjY1MjU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/native-router/core/commit/a3ed26dcd5305879d8187bd843c4358380702b2e","node_id":"C_kwDOKR3RqtoAKGEzZWQyNmRjZDUzMDU4NzlkODE4N2JkODQzYzQzNTgzODA3MDJiMmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/native-router/core/commit/4fc0785a79c19fe909e6bd4a3a5ca1ddf145cea6","sha":"4fc0785a79c19fe909e6bd4a3a5ca1ddf145cea6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-router/core/commits/4fc0785a79c19fe909e6bd4a3a5ca1ddf145cea6"}],"sha":"a3ed26dcd5305879d8187bd843c4358380702b2e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-router/core/commits/a3ed26dcd5305879d8187bd843c4358380702b2e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5526525?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wmzy","id":5526525,"login":"wmzy","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1MjY1MjU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-router/core/commits/4fc0785a79c19fe909e6bd4a3a5ca1ddf145cea6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-02T02:16:27Z","email":"1256573276@qq.com","name":"wmzy"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-02T02:16:27Z","email":"1256573276@qq.com","name":"wmzy"},"message":"style(core): clear the leftover eslint errors and normalize formatting\n\nRename the shadowing `result` binding in writeSchema''s project helper,\nreplace the for...of loop in omitDefaults with a forEach, and take the\nprettier pass over the writeSchema test fixtures — the tree is lint\nclean again.","tree":{"sha":"bd02b22af3748b42aaa9cdb6f424c6f75956a366","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-router/core/git/trees/bd02b22af3748b42aaa9cdb6f424c6f75956a366"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-router/core/git/commits/4fc0785a79c19fe909e6bd4a3a5ca1ddf145cea6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5526525?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wmzy","id":5526525,"login":"wmzy","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1MjY1MjU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/native-router/core/commit/4fc0785a79c19fe909e6bd4a3a5ca1ddf145cea6","node_id":"C_kwDOKR3RqtoAKDRmYzA3ODVhNzljMTlmZTkwOWU2YmQ0YTNhNWNhMWRkZjE0NWNlYTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/native-router/core/commit/b05b523ab7a47d0832f6bee8473837e30a08ede0","sha":"b05b523ab7a47d0832f6bee8473837e30a08ede0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-router/core/commits/b05b523ab7a47d0832f6bee8473837e30a08ede0"}],"sha":"4fc0785a79c19fe909e6bd4a3a5ca1ddf145cea6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-router/core/commits/4fc0785a79c19fe909e6bd4a3a5ca1ddf145cea6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5526525?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wmzy","id":5526525,"login":"wmzy","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1MjY1MjU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-router/core/commits/b05b523ab7a47d0832f6bee8473837e30a08ede0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-01T15:24:38Z","email":"1256573276@qq.com","name":"wmzy"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-01T15:24:38Z","email":"1256573276@qq.com","name":"wmzy"},"message":"feat(core): derive clean-URL write search schemas from read schemas via writeSchema\n\nRead schemas coerce and default, so writing their output back would put\nthe defaults into the query. writeSchema(schema, defaults) validates\nthrough the same read contract, then strips keys equal to their default\n(Object.is): one read schema covers both directions, replacing the\nhand-written write-side twin consumers had to maintain (typing the\nprojection via WriteSearchOutputOf — defaulted/read-optional keys become\noptional, the rest stay required; sync in sync out, rejections pass\nthrough untouched).","tree":{"sha":"0959d8dff8325934afb37649f924af1bf36630c0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-router/core/git/trees/0959d8dff8325934afb37649f924af1bf36630c0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-router/core/git/commits/b05b523ab7a47d0832f6bee8473837e30a08ede0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5526525?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wmzy","id":5526525,"login":"wmzy","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1MjY1MjU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/native-router/core/commit/b05b523ab7a47d0832f6bee8473837e30a08ede0","node_id":"C_kwDOKR3RqtoAKGIwNWI1MjNhYjdhNDdkMDgzMmY2YmVlODQ3MzgzN2UzMGEwOGVkZTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/native-router/core/commit/b788a2aa959e43877d4946558eabf6afacbf3884","sha":"b788a2aa959e43877d4946558eabf6afacbf3884","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-router/core/commits/b788a2aa959e43877d4946558eabf6afacbf3884"}],"sha":"b05b523ab7a47d0832f6bee8473837e30a08ede0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-router/core/commits/b05b523ab7a47d0832f6bee8473837e30a08ede0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5526525?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wmzy","id":5526525,"login":"wmzy","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1MjY1MjU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-router/core/commits/b788a2aa959e43877d4946558eabf6afacbf3884/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-31T18:45:34Z","email":"1256573276@qq.com","name":"wmzy"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-31T18:45:34Z","email":"1256573276@qq.com","name":"wmzy"},"message":"feat(core): reuse the current view snapshot for same-route search navigations via searchDeps\n\nA navigation to the same pathname re-ran the whole chain (every level''s\nbeforeLoad, resolveView and lazy component imports) however small the\nsearch change was. Routes can now declare the search keys their\nresolution consumes:\n\n- BaseRoute.searchDeps: string[] | ((search: SearchInput) => unknown) —\n  the array form picks keys from the degraded input ([] = the level\n  ignores the search); the function form derives a projection compared\n  after JSON.stringify\n- navigate() takes the fast path when every level of the matched chain\n  declares searchDeps and no projection changed between the current\n  entry and the target: the current view snapshot is committed as the\n  new entry — zero guards, zero loaders, zero imports, exactly like a\n  POP hitting the viewStack\n- reusableEntry(router, location) exports the check for framework\n  navigation setters committing search updates through the same\n  semantics\n- Undeclared levels keep today''s behavior byte for byte: any navigation\n  re-resolves the whole chain; hash and state are never compared","tree":{"sha":"c44156e2136d2b07b4881aaa744d722f52424b7f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-router/core/git/trees/c44156e2136d2b07b4881aaa744d722f52424b7f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-router/core/git/commits/b788a2aa959e43877d4946558eabf6afacbf3884","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5526525?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wmzy","id":5526525,"login":"wmzy","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1MjY1MjU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/native-router/core/commit/b788a2aa959e43877d4946558eabf6afacbf3884","node_id":"C_kwDOKR3RqtoAKGI3ODhhMmFhOTU5ZTQzODc3ZDQ5NDY1NThlYWJmNmFmYWNiZjM4ODQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/native-router/core/commit/f615dad65229bf80a2b24886202a2a33bfbdc857","sha":"f615dad65229bf80a2b24886202a2a33bfbdc857","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-router/core/commits/f615dad65229bf80a2b24886202a2a33bfbdc857"}],"sha":"b788a2aa959e43877d4946558eabf6afacbf3884","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-router/core/commits/b788a2aa959e43877d4946558eabf6afacbf3884"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5526525?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wmzy","id":5526525,"login":"wmzy","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1MjY1MjU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-router/core/commits/f615dad65229bf80a2b24886202a2a33bfbdc857/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-31T10:28:15Z","email":"1256573276@qq.com","name":"wmzy"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-31T10:28:15Z","email":"1256573276@qq.com","name":"wmzy"},"message":"feat(core): report the navigation action to listen callbacks\n\nlisten''s onViewChange now receives the navigation disposition — ''push'' |\n''replace'' | ''pop'' (NavAction) — as a second argument: how the navigation\ncommitted, mirroring the history action with the vetoed-POP rewind landing\nreported as ''pop''. Non-breaking: existing single-argument callbacks stay\nvalid. This is the direction signal view-transition bindings consume.","tree":{"sha":"94eb56eb3051eac9302cabd57dcac442b0c575c0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-router/core/git/trees/94eb56eb3051eac9302cabd57dcac442b0c575c0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-router/core/git/commits/f615dad65229bf80a2b24886202a2a33bfbdc857","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5526525?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wmzy","id":5526525,"login":"wmzy","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1MjY1MjU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/native-router/core/commit/f615dad65229bf80a2b24886202a2a33bfbdc857","node_id":"C_kwDOKR3RqtoAKGY2MTVkYWQ2NTIyOWJmODBhMmIyNDg4NjIwMmEyYTMzYmZiZGM4NTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/native-router/core/commit/3877fe028ad6ee1deaf7d226914f9e05e69a6f44","sha":"3877fe028ad6ee1deaf7d226914f9e05e69a6f44","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-router/core/commits/3877fe028ad6ee1deaf7d226914f9e05e69a6f44"}],"sha":"f615dad65229bf80a2b24886202a2a33bfbdc857","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-router/core/commits/f615dad65229bf80a2b24886202a2a33bfbdc857"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5526525?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wmzy","id":5526525,"login":"wmzy","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1MjY1MjU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-router/core/commits/3877fe028ad6ee1deaf7d226914f9e05e69a6f44/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-29T16:43:25Z","email":"1256573276@qq.com","name":"wmzy"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-29T16:43:25Z","email":"1256573276@qq.com","name":"wmzy"},"message":"feat(core): inject a per-instance context into guards and loaders\n\ncreate() accepts {context} — a synchronous value baked in per router\ninstance, handed to beforeLoad guards (GuardContext.context) and\nresolveView implementations (ResolveViewContext.context). The value''s\ntype is inferred from the option into RouterInstance<R, V, C>; without\nthe option the context is undefined and existing types/behavior are\nunchanged. Per-instance state isolates test fixtures and micro-frontend\npanes where a module singleton would leak.","tree":{"sha":"e0350efcb72378fe890f4090acf0d6226b180960","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-router/core/git/trees/e0350efcb72378fe890f4090acf0d6226b180960"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-router/core/git/commits/3877fe028ad6ee1deaf7d226914f9e05e69a6f44","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5526525?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wmzy","id":5526525,"login":"wmzy","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1MjY1MjU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/native-router/core/commit/3877fe028ad6ee1deaf7d226914f9e05e69a6f44","node_id":"C_kwDOKR3RqtoAKDM4NzdmZTAyOGFkNmVlMWRlYWY3ZDIyNjkxNGY5ZTA1ZTY5YTZmNDQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/native-router/core/commit/380e2d65f72593c9dd35e87230a2a0213297fadc","sha":"380e2d65f72593c9dd35e87230a2a0213297fadc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-router/core/commits/380e2d65f72593c9dd35e87230a2a0213297fadc"}],"sha":"3877fe028ad6ee1deaf7d226914f9e05e69a6f44","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-router/core/commits/3877fe028ad6ee1deaf7d226914f9e05e69a6f44"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5526525?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wmzy","id":5526525,"login":"wmzy","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1MjY1MjU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-router/core/commits/380e2d65f72593c9dd35e87230a2a0213297fadc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-29T01:53:33Z","email":"1256573276@qq.com","name":"wmzy"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-29T01:53:33Z","email":"1256573276@qq.com","name":"wmzy"},"message":"fix(core): align the params schema with redirect semantics and make GuardContext params generic\n\nR4: resolveEntry validated a redirect level''s params schema\nunconditionally, while the same level''s search schema is short-circuited\nby redirect — the only observable effect of hanging a params schema on a\nredirect level was failing the navigation. Skip the schema when\nredirect is set: the level''s guard never runs, so the coerced output has\nno consumer. Redirect levels with failing schemas now redirect cleanly.\n\nR3: GuardContext.params was hardcoded to Record<string, string>, which\ncontradicts the params-schema coerce semantics — a coercing schema''s\noutput is not assignable to the raw string map (TS2322 under strict).\nAdd a third type argument P (default Record<string, string>, appended\nafter S so existing two-argument instantiations keep their meaning);\nthread the schema output through it to type what the guard receives.\n\nR5: document the same-name parent/child param segment semantics — the\ndeep-over-shallow merge operates on raw strings, so the child''s value\noverwrites the parent''s coerced one — in both READMEs, pinned by a test.\n\nAlso add a typecheck script (tsconfig.test.json over src+test) so the\nnew test/types.test.ts contracts are enforced, and quiet two latent\nno-await-in-loop errors in the cancel test that made lint red.","tree":{"sha":"ff7d4bc831ea0d7d5f8159abfe1be39625f4e5e3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-router/core/git/trees/ff7d4bc831ea0d7d5f8159abfe1be39625f4e5e3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-router/core/git/commits/380e2d65f72593c9dd35e87230a2a0213297fadc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5526525?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wmzy","id":5526525,"login":"wmzy","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1MjY1MjU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/native-router/core/commit/380e2d65f72593c9dd35e87230a2a0213297fadc","node