ttps://api.github.com/users/wmzy","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-router/core/commits/678dfe907b45ba293484f4413898bcb0207a0f24/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-26T16:34:05Z","email":"1256573276@qq.com","name":"wmzy"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-26T16:34:05Z","email":"1256573276@qq.com","name":"wmzy"},"message":"feat: add navigation blockers (setBlocker)\n\nRegister a synchronous (to, from) => boolean veto over path strings, asked\nat the head of every navigate/commit/commitReplace and before each history\nPOP lands. A vetoed navigation never starts its chain (no guard, no\nloader, no controller) and its promise settles immediately — a veto is\nnot an error, unlike a cancelled navigation. Blockers sit before the\ncontroller so cancelled/superseded promises stay unaffected, and a\nblocker that throws counts as a veto without escaping into history\nlisteners. Adds the setBlocker API, README docs, and test coverage.","tree":{"sha":"3dc043ec710ad6a10984170cc5a1056db24433c4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-router/core/git/trees/3dc043ec710ad6a10984170cc5a1056db24433c4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/native-router/core/git/commits/678dfe907b45ba293484f4413898bcb0207a0f24","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5526525?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/wmzy","id":5526525,"login":"wmzy","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1MjY1MjU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wmzy/received_events","repos_url":"http